            "review_title": "Review at Nhà hàng Nom 3 Ngô Quyền",
            "review_text": "pngocduong1\nUnited States1252 contributions\n0\nDinner experA Beautiful Restaurant with Excellent Dessertsience\nAug 2026 • Family\nThe food at Chợ Nom was good and the menu is very extensive, offering plenty of choices. We also loved the beautiful décor and unique design of the restaurant, which created a charming atmosphere. The highlights of our meal were the desserts, particularly the kem xôi and chè sương sá hột lựu, which were absolutely amazing and some of our favorite items we tried.\n Unfortunately, the small bánh xèo was much too oily, even after we requested it be made with very little oil, and my husband was unable to eat it. \nThe live band was a nice addition, but our dining experience was affected by three children running around and screaming loudly throughout the restaurant, making it difficult to relax and enjoy the music and our dinner. Overall, a beautiful restaurant with good food, but a few issues kept the experience from being exceptional.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nCome when theres live band and singer around 7 pm\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 23, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
